cket verify CI run [`44876502133`](https://github.com/ArrokothI/arrokothi/actions/runs/44876502133) at C: `checks_passed`, 19 of 19; repository tests 5,322 of 5,322 with no skip; the registry 315 cases and 351 kills, each of the twelve candidate cases killed with `semantic_credit: none`; adoption `mappings_complete`; `run.txt` records revision = head = C (Node v26.10.0, Linux x86_64, 2026-11-21 06:38 to 08:01 UTC). Review of the cumulative candidate by a Codex GPT-6 session; no self-acceptance. K1.4-gate stays PLANNED. |
